WEBVTT

00:00:02.198 --> 00:00:09.988
Candy and Terry, who were both invited to the barn
with a fake letter, were discovered by sister Gray.

00:00:15.731 --> 00:00:17.368
Candice White Adley!

00:00:17.403 --> 00:00:22.210
You have made a very serious offense;
therefore, you are expelled from the school!

00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:29.728
Until your family arrives to pick you up,
you will be confined to the tower!

00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:40.114
Terrius G. Grandchester!
You are confined to your room for a week!

00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:45.877
The punishment for Candy and Terry
were indeed quite different.

00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:48.843
But Candy wasn't aware of that.

00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:55.103
Within the cold, thick walls.

00:01:02.179 --> 00:01:04.039
They didn't give me the time
to explain myself.

00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:06.866
Everybody acted as if thigs
were crystally clear.

00:01:07.883 --> 00:01:10.353
I can still hear Terry's voice.

00:01:11.873 --> 00:01:12.800
Terry.

00:01:16.764 --> 00:01:18.270
Candy! Candy!

00:01:18.305 --> 00:01:19.448
Terry!

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.686
Candy!

00:01:25.758 --> 00:01:29.837
All of this must have been Eliza's idea.
Why didn't they understand?

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:32.036
It wouldn't have ended like this!

00:01:33.482 --> 00:01:37.333
Whatever the reason, you and Terry were doing it!

00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:41.783
When I arrived to the barn with sisters,
both of you were inside!

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.749
Two of them alone! No wonder they got expelled!

00:01:45.895 --> 00:01:47.078
What a disgrace!

00:01:52.643 --> 00:01:57.466
No! I got expelled over such a misunderstanding!

00:01:58.515 --> 00:02:00.429
I somehow have to escape from here.

00:02:01.265 --> 00:02:02.940
I have to see sister Gray!

00:02:05.345 --> 00:02:06.397
Let me out!

00:02:06.569 --> 00:02:08.778
Let me out of here!

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:13.126
Sister Gray.

00:02:13.654 --> 00:02:15.877
Why wasn't I expelled from the school?

00:02:16.232 --> 00:02:17.128
Terrius...

00:02:18.006 --> 00:02:20.255
Weren't you supposed to be confined to your own room?

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.454
Please, answer me!

00:02:23.794 --> 00:02:25.125
Get out, now!

00:02:26.235 --> 00:02:29.894
Leaving your room without permission
during confinement is a violation of rules!

00:02:30.058 --> 00:02:32.929
In that case, how come that I wasn't expelled as well?

00:02:33.345 --> 00:02:34.930
Why wasn't I confined to the school's tower?

00:02:35.283 --> 00:02:37.419
Why wasn't I treated the same way as Candy?

00:02:37.511 --> 00:02:38.641
Why is that?

00:02:40.553 --> 00:02:44.690
It's because the cosequences of these actions
don't bear the same weight for boys and girls!

00:02:44.691 --> 00:02:45.997
Sister Gray.

00:02:46.418 --> 00:02:48.551
If it's because my dad keeps
donating money to the school,

00:02:48.859 --> 00:02:50.880
...how come you weren't frank about it?

00:02:51.973 --> 00:02:56.256
Terrius G. Grandchester!
Take back what you said now!

00:02:56.432 --> 00:02:58.405
I haven't taken any donations!

00:02:58.909 --> 00:03:01.864
In that case, punish me the same way
you punished Candy!

00:03:05.136 --> 00:03:06.166
Sister Gray.

00:03:06.721 --> 00:03:09.333
You could examine the incident more carefully.

00:03:10.117 --> 00:03:11.406
That was a ploy!

00:03:11.559 --> 00:03:16.082
Somebody wrote fake notes in order
to lure both of us into the same place!

00:03:17.918 --> 00:03:22.964
Whether it's a ploy or not, you were found
late at night in the barn!

00:03:23.151 --> 00:03:24.556
That is enough!

00:03:25.342 --> 00:03:27.919
Moreover, for a young girl to behave like that...

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:31.057
I can't just forgive her!

00:03:32.392 --> 00:03:33.835
There is no helping it, then.

00:03:34.182 --> 00:03:39.994
If it's come to this, there is no other way
but to ask my father to have Candy's expulsion revoked.

00:03:41.585 --> 00:03:43.185
Duke Grandchester?

00:03:44.914 --> 00:03:47.391
My dad's influence is quite something, I guess.

00:03:47.618 --> 00:03:48.607
Terrius!

00:03:50.227 --> 00:03:58.762
If you do this, you won't only hurt the honour of
this school, you'll also hurt the honour of your family!

00:04:00.322 --> 00:04:01.817
Just what is honour?

00:04:02.181 --> 00:04:03.619
Wha... what?

00:04:04.656 --> 00:04:10.289
Duke Grandchester is a honourable man!
He puts up with you doing whatever you please!

00:04:10.865 --> 00:04:15.448
Most importantly, I am not obliged to obey
Duke Grandchester on such matters!

00:04:16.118 --> 00:04:20.229
Now, return to your room!
Terrius G. Grandchester!

00:04:29.983 --> 00:04:31.310
Now what...

00:04:31.977 --> 00:04:35.712
I... I even resorted to help from my father
whom I hate so much...

00:04:38.091 --> 00:04:41.829
Candy... what can I do to help you?

00:04:42.945 --> 00:04:44.123
What can I do?

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.313
Candy.

00:04:46.682 --> 00:04:47.924
What can I do?

00:04:56.278 --> 00:04:58.498
I can't do anything but cry now.

00:04:59.802 --> 00:05:02.350
I go all weepy as soon as noone is watching.

00:05:06.878 --> 00:05:11.888
They are going to inform Grandfather William
about my expulsion...

00:05:12.882 --> 00:05:15.005
...the man who adopted me as his foster daughter!

00:05:15.852 --> 00:05:18.686
He eagerly wanted me to become a lady!

00:05:20.433 --> 00:05:21.940
Grandfather William.

00:05:22.457 --> 00:05:24.033
He's going to be crushed.

00:05:37.301 --> 00:05:39.134
Poor Candy.

00:05:39.978 --> 00:05:44.364
Not only that they expelled her,
but they also locked her in the tower.

00:05:46.286 --> 00:05:48.264
Everybody was biased against her.

00:05:48.819 --> 00:05:52.095
Terrius was only confined to his
room for a week!

00:05:52.467 --> 00:05:56.294
Patty, I'm going to inform Archie and Stear
about this.

00:05:57.108 --> 00:06:00.872
I'm sure that those two will get
some good ideas on how we could help Candy.

00:06:01.619 --> 00:06:06.082
Annie, if they see you, you could
end up like Candy!

00:06:06.685 --> 00:06:11.288
I don't care. If they see me, I'll
be expelled together with Candy.

00:06:12.257 --> 00:06:13.254
Annie!

00:06:14.883 --> 00:06:18.294
Up until now, Candy was always
the one who helped me.

00:06:18.627 --> 00:06:21.066
Therefore, this time it's my turn
to help her!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.407
I understand, Annie.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.261
I feel the same way.

00:06:26.355 --> 00:06:28.720
-Let's go together.
-Thank you, Patty!

00:06:29.077 --> 00:06:32.190
But leaving this room could pose a problem!

00:06:32.382 --> 00:06:34.309
If somebody sees us...

00:06:34.511 --> 00:06:36.852
We'll go Candy's way!

00:06:37.903 --> 00:06:40.745
Now, Patty, let's tie together these sheets!

00:06:41.358 --> 00:06:42.834
Sheets?

00:06:43.307 --> 00:06:48.633
We can't jump around Tarzan-style, like Candy,
so we'll use this instead.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.034
Through the yard?

00:06:52.122 --> 00:06:53.246
It'll be okay.

00:06:54.423 --> 00:06:58.096
I didn't know you were capable of this.

00:06:58.253 --> 00:06:59.991
Must be Candy's influence.

00:07:00.518 --> 00:07:01.793
Now, let's go.

00:07:11.582 --> 00:07:13.908
Annie, am I doing well?

00:07:14.278 --> 00:07:17.350
Yes, Patty! Just don't look down!

00:07:17.937 --> 00:07:19.297
Of course I won't!

00:07:34.808 --> 00:07:38.610
Annie, don't stop... quickly, let me down!
I'm scared!

00:07:39.409 --> 00:07:40.868
You're already on the ground.

00:07:42.804 --> 00:07:44.157
Really!

00:07:59.567 --> 00:08:02.045
Archie's and Stear's room is up here!

00:08:02.448 --> 00:08:04.088
How do we go inside?

00:08:04.923 --> 00:08:10.784
Just like Candy; we climb this tree, go across
that branch, but then we'll have to jump to the balcony.

00:08:11.421 --> 00:08:15.695
Maybe if we threw a stone at their window;
Stear and Archie will probably notice.

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:20.768
You can't do that! If the stone bangs
up against the glass, others will hear it as well.

00:08:21.413 --> 00:08:23.755
Annie, have you ever climbed a tree?

00:08:24.256 --> 00:08:28.994
No, but I watched Candy while she was doing it.
I think I'll do okay.

00:08:42.227 --> 00:08:44.151
It's hopeless...

00:08:46.348 --> 00:08:47.435
Well, Archie...

00:08:48.816 --> 00:08:52.881
I'm thinking about building a lie detector.
What do you think?

00:08:53.814 --> 00:08:55.311
Lie detector?

00:08:55.418 --> 00:08:59.279
Yes. It can tell you whether one
is telling a lie or not!

00:09:00.524 --> 00:09:02.135
Sounds fun!

00:09:02.995 --> 00:09:05.334
We're still pretty far from the balcony...

00:09:07.775 --> 00:09:09.477
I'm afraid!

00:09:11.164 --> 00:09:16.723
-Jumping down from such a high place...
-...would take Candy's skill to do it...

00:09:27.792 --> 00:09:29.877
Archie, what was that sound?

00:09:29.941 --> 00:09:31.245
Must be Candy!

00:09:33.871 --> 00:09:36.167
Oww...

00:09:37.005 --> 00:09:39.096
-Annie!
-Patty!

00:09:42.179 --> 00:09:44.262
Why are you two here?

00:09:46.271 --> 00:09:47.467
Are you okay?

00:09:48.933 --> 00:09:51.326
Archie, Candy is in big trouble!

00:09:51.546 --> 00:09:53.337
-What? Candy?
-What? Candy?

00:09:56.603 --> 00:10:00.336
Now that Candy was expelled,
she won't be by my side anymore.

00:10:01.423 --> 00:10:02.448
Candy.

00:10:02.743 --> 00:10:03.953
What should I do?

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:10.759
Sitting alone and worrying in my room...
it won't do you any good.

00:10:13.923 --> 00:10:15.014
Terrius!

00:10:15.049 --> 00:10:16.165
You bastard!

00:10:19.948 --> 00:10:21.026
Archie!

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:24.099
What did you do to Candy?!

00:10:28.716 --> 00:10:31.599
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is a CM break.

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:39.765
Terry, we're seeing you in a different light now.
We misjudged you.

00:10:40.201 --> 00:10:41.405
You idiot!

00:10:41.896 --> 00:10:45.145
Why did you call Candy to the barn?

00:10:46.106 --> 00:10:47.312
Calm down, Archie!

00:10:47.816 --> 00:10:49.679
What good does it make
if you two fight now?

00:10:50.938 --> 00:10:52.223
Don't hold me back, brother!

00:10:52.326 --> 00:10:55.522
Candy was expelled because of this idiot!

00:10:56.824 --> 00:11:01.040
Archie, people from other rooms will notice
unless you calm down.

00:11:01.101 --> 00:11:05.928
If grandfather William loses his temper, disowns Candy
and drives her away from the Adley family...

00:11:07.629 --> 00:11:11.484
Where would she go then?

00:11:11.887 --> 00:11:12.982
Where?

00:11:13.688 --> 00:11:15.193
Disown her?

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.781
Candy...

00:11:22.832 --> 00:11:24.722
You! Say something!

00:11:28.587 --> 00:11:29.634
It wasn't me.

00:11:35.012 --> 00:11:37.557
I didn't call Candy to the barn.

00:11:40.421 --> 00:11:42.430
I was called by her.

00:11:45.978 --> 00:11:46.939
A note?

00:11:50.336 --> 00:11:51.734
I'd like to talk to you about some
very important matters.

00:11:51.769 --> 00:11:54.002
Tonight at 8 o'clock, I'll be waiting
in the barn. Candy.

00:11:54.662 --> 00:11:55.722
Candy?

00:11:56.814 --> 00:11:59.466
This isn't Candy's handwriting!

00:12:01.328 --> 00:12:02.470
Exactly my thoughts.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:03.655
This handwriting...

00:12:04.156 --> 00:12:05.561
This handwriting...

00:12:06.489 --> 00:12:07.675
Eliza!

00:12:08.128 --> 00:12:09.678
Eliza?

00:12:10.781 --> 00:12:13.195
She purposely changed her handwriting a bit...

00:12:13.395 --> 00:12:15.934
...but I'm sure that this is Eliza's handwriting!

00:12:17.669 --> 00:12:19.159
What a horrible thing!

00:12:20.962 --> 00:12:24.705
Very well. Let's show this to sister Gray.
If we do that...

00:12:25.031 --> 00:12:26.716
...Candy might be freed!

00:12:26.717 --> 00:12:28.402
Hardly. Think about it.

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:31.830
They won't accept it.

00:12:33.116 --> 00:12:35.993
Then... We'll have Eliza admit it herself!

00:12:36.561 --> 00:12:40.509
If we do that, sister Gray will have to accept it.

00:12:57.404 --> 00:13:02.539
Calling me to such a place...
Just what do you want from me?

00:13:06.718 --> 00:13:08.368
We'd like to speak to you about Candy.

00:13:09.152 --> 00:13:13.480
My, weaklings like you want to speak to me?

00:13:13.911 --> 00:13:15.706
It is us who'd like to speak to you!

00:13:19.591 --> 00:13:20.522
What is it?

00:13:22.776 --> 00:13:24.588
Are you threatening me?

00:13:25.104 --> 00:13:27.061
It's not like we are threatening you, Eliza.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:29.718
We only want a little bit of honesty from you.

00:13:30.608 --> 00:13:33.418
Eliza, you wrote this?

00:13:35.501 --> 00:13:36.885
I don't know!

00:13:37.121 --> 00:13:38.352
Don't give us that!

00:13:39.099 --> 00:13:40.627
We are sure that this is your handwriting.

00:13:41.957 --> 00:13:43.827
Maybe it was you who wrote that?

00:13:43.993 --> 00:13:46.221
Damn it, I'll get a confession out of you!

00:13:48.552 --> 00:13:49.633
You'd hit a lady?

00:13:50.852 --> 00:13:52.295
What kind of lady are you?

00:13:52.482 --> 00:13:53.824
I'm not going to hit you!

00:13:54.274 --> 00:13:57.142
I'm too disgusted to touch that putrid face of yours!

00:13:57.724 --> 00:13:59.051
What horrible words!

00:14:01.114 --> 00:14:03.544
Eliza, please! Help Candy!

00:14:03.834 --> 00:14:05.440
And this one is going to try to move me with her tears!

00:14:05.938 --> 00:14:12.187
Eliza, if you say the truth, Candy's
expulsion will be revoked!

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:13.856
Hold on a second.

00:14:14.498 --> 00:14:18.735
You are saying that it was my fault
that Candy was expelled,

00:14:19.382 --> 00:14:21.734
...but I don't know anything!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:22.763
Eliza.

00:14:23.497 --> 00:14:25.332
Shit, I'll get you to say the truth
even if I have to strangle you!

00:14:25.367 --> 00:14:26.405
Archie, don't!

00:14:26.691 --> 00:14:29.986
Even if you kill her, you won't
get the truth out of Eliza.

00:14:37.006 --> 00:14:40.777
Wouldn't it be better if you worried more
about yourselves than about Candy?

00:14:41.138 --> 00:14:42.052
What?

00:14:42.635 --> 00:14:44.834
You called me out to this place.

00:14:45.038 --> 00:14:48.338
If somebody finds out how you threatened me,
I wonder what will happen?

00:14:50.401 --> 00:14:52.472
Just this time, I'll turn a blind eye.

00:14:53.062 --> 00:14:53.980
See you!

00:15:27.314 --> 00:15:28.372
Shit!

00:15:28.547 --> 00:15:29.943
What should we do?

00:15:34.306 --> 00:15:38.077
Why didn't I think of that lie detector before?

00:15:38.631 --> 00:15:43.141
Candy went through all of this
just to end up expelled from the school?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.147
Hasn't she made any difference?

00:15:47.791 --> 00:15:50.413
No, Candy left something big after herself.

00:15:50.763 --> 00:15:55.461
She helped to build a large, strong and
growing friendship between two people.

00:15:55.684 --> 00:15:56.652
Two?

00:15:56.676 --> 00:15:58.187
Patty and Annie.

00:15:58.536 --> 00:16:03.440
It was Candy who brought them together.
It was all Candy's doing.

00:16:04.018 --> 00:16:07.915
Are you fine with Candy no longer
being in this school?

00:16:08.097 --> 00:16:10.875
-No, I wasn't saying that.
-Please, calm down.

00:16:11.714 --> 00:16:13.922
If you must fight, could you please take it outside?

00:16:14.697 --> 00:16:18.678
"Take it outside", was it?
Aren't you worried about Candy?

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:21.781
How can you be so calm and indifferent!

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:23.876
Calm?

00:16:24.206 --> 00:16:25.905
I am anything but calm.

00:16:30.288 --> 00:16:31.942
Both of you, please leave!

00:16:31.977 --> 00:16:33.330
-You...!
-Archie!

00:16:34.046 --> 00:16:35.284
Brother!

00:16:35.584 --> 00:16:37.828
Let's go.
Let's leave him if he just wants to stand there.

00:16:40.322 --> 00:16:41.442
Terrius.

00:16:41.522 --> 00:16:47.600
Candy went through a lot.
That's why we are trying to make her happy.

00:16:49.596 --> 00:16:51.426
Terry, don't you feel the same way?

00:16:57.995 --> 00:16:59.852
I didn't have it difficult like Candy.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.733
My goodness...

00:17:03.282 --> 00:17:04.819
The Candy I know - -

00:17:07.684 --> 00:17:09.174
...is always cheerful...

00:17:12.384 --> 00:17:14.477
And yet, she grew up knowing she was an orphan.

00:17:16.063 --> 00:17:17.830
And what was I doing till now?

00:17:18.456 --> 00:17:22.171
Rebelling against my father...
...wasting his money...

00:17:29.364 --> 00:17:37.047
Duke Grandchester is a honourable man!
He puts up with you doing whatever you please!

00:17:38.983 --> 00:17:40.016
Damn it!

00:17:42.727 --> 00:17:44.240
I won't allow anyone to mess with you, Candy!

00:17:44.803 --> 00:17:46.439
I won't forgive those who caused you grief!

00:17:49.297 --> 00:17:52.741
Now I'm the only one who can protect Candy.

00:17:53.276 --> 00:17:54.252
Nobody but me!

00:18:30.266 --> 00:18:31.221
Kurin?

00:18:32.424 --> 00:18:34.142
Kurin... where are you?

00:18:35.133 --> 00:18:36.145
Where are you?

00:18:36.409 --> 00:18:37.243
Kurin!

00:18:38.524 --> 00:18:39.828
You're underneath this?

00:18:49.136 --> 00:18:50.167
Kurin!

00:18:56.492 --> 00:18:57.264
Thank you!

00:18:58.938 --> 00:19:03.571
Kurin, you got this muddy just to come
over to my place?

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:07.263
Candy.

00:19:08.549 --> 00:19:09.811
I will stay here.

00:19:10.378 --> 00:19:11.478
Until the morning...

00:19:12.481 --> 00:19:16.604
If I was older, both Candy and I
would've been able to leave this school,

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:20.942
...while laughing and saying goodbye
without any regrets.

00:19:22.008 --> 00:19:23.610
And then we could live together.

00:19:35.685 --> 00:19:36.611
Terry?

00:19:37.199 --> 00:19:38.540
Terry, it's you?

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:40.900
Terry!

00:19:42.559 --> 00:19:43.558
Terry!

00:19:44.442 --> 00:19:46.423
Terry! Terry!

00:19:48.878 --> 00:19:49.795
Candy!

00:19:49.888 --> 00:19:52.062
Candy, cheer up!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.175
I will, Terry!

00:19:55.054 --> 00:19:57.399
Terry, what happened? You weren't punished?

00:19:58.067 --> 00:19:59.658
Punishment, it's a bunch of crap!

00:20:02.306 --> 00:20:03.932
Terry, it's you!

00:20:06.033 --> 00:20:07.481
Exactly, Candy!

00:20:08.409 --> 00:20:10.136
Whatever happens, you shouldn't grieve!

00:20:10.496 --> 00:20:11.513
You should laugh cheerfully!

00:20:11.905 --> 00:20:13.968
Yeah, I understand!

00:20:17.603 --> 00:20:19.194
Thank you, Terry.

00:20:20.234 --> 00:20:21.982
I won't cry.

00:20:22.611 --> 00:20:24.201
I will laugh cheerfully.

00:20:24.796 --> 00:20:29.352
If it weren't for these thick walls,
I would've shown you my smile.

00:20:31.997 --> 00:20:34.764
I must decide...
...it's for Candy's sake!

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.035
I must decide now!

00:20:39.949 --> 00:20:45.750
After bringing his decision,
Terry appeared very sad.

00:20:48.713 --> 00:20:53.048
However, Candy, who was locked up in the tower,
did not know of this.

00:20:53.995 --> 00:20:57.633
The melody which Terry played on his harmonica

00:20:57.668 --> 00:21:01.713
...was something that gave Candy the strength
and courage to pick herself up.

00:21:16.377 --> 00:21:20.313
To be continued.
